  "notes": "{対|たい}する is a suru-verb meaning to face, confront, or be directed toward something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{対|たい}する + noun: ~ regarding/toward ~ (prenominal)\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{対|たい}して: toward ~, in response to ~ (adverbial)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{問題|もんだい}→問題：00797_mondai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{対|たい}する: regarding a problem\n- ⟦{質問|しつもん}→質問：00888_shitsumon⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{対|たい}する⟦{回答|かいとう}→回答：00142_kaitou⟧: answer to a question\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{対|たい}する⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧: attitude toward ~\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{対|たい}する⟦{関心|かんしん}→関心：00182_kanshin⟧: interest in ~\n\nUSAGE:\n- Formal and written style\n- Common in business, academic, and news contexts\n- Often implies a relationship between two things\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\nThe casual equivalent is often simply ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ or ⟦について→について：03103_nitsuite⟧.",
